  "id": "hscl",
  "term": "HSCL",
  "definition": "HSCL usually refers here to the Hopkins Symptom Checklist, especially the 25-item HSCL-25. It is a brief self-report questionnaire used in primary care to assess symptoms of anxiety and depression, and this source describes it as a reliable, valid, essentially one-dimensional screening tool combining those symptom areas.",
